  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1136\">\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1136\"><strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1008\">Positive BCL-6 Expression</strong> is commonly associated with germinal center B-cell origin lymphomas (e.g. follicular lymphoma, DLBCL &ndash; germinal center type).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1207\">\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1207\"><strong data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1157\">Negative BCL-6</strong> may indicate non-germinal center B-cell origin.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1341\">\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1341\">Interpretation should be made in conjunction with other IHC markers (e.g. CD10, MUM1, BCL-2) and clinical-pathological correlation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
